    "description": "Set on a white-sand beach on the Atlantic Ocean, this luxury resort is 7 km from local dining in Arawak Cay, and 8 km from Lynden Pindling International Airport.\nAccommodations range from chic rooms with decorative murals to stylish 2-bedroom apartments with luxe kitchens and ocean views. All offer private balconies, plus free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and minibars.\nAmenities include 2 outdoor pools (1 with a bar), plus a spa, a gym and a golf course. There are also 3 swanky restaurants, a nightclub, a lobby bar and a casino. Airport shuttle service is available (fee)."
